# Bhairavi lehra, Teentaal (16 matras, 4 vibhags of 4)
# Bhairavi thaat: all komal — r g d n (plus S m P shuddha).
# Grammar: newline or '|' separates vibhags; space separates matras;
#          ',' splits a matra in two; '-' sustains; ' = taar, . = mandra.
# Resolves on r -> S at sam.
S r g m
P d P m
g m P d
P m g r
